# Copy to ~/.config/grokbot-usage/session and replace with your real token.
# Get WorkosCursorSessionToken from a signed-in browser:
#   DevTools → Application → Cookies → https://cursor.com → WorkosCursorSessionToken
# NEVER commit the real file. NEVER paste the token into chat.
#
# Either form works:

WorkosCursorSessionToken=user_XXXX%3A%3AeyJhbGciOi...

# — or bare token value —
# user_XXXX::eyJhbGciOi...
